{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About Trade Academy:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Trade Academy, students are trained for the action-packed world of stock trading through a uniquely brutal training method, &quot;Stock Duels.&quot; One-on-One battles, where students both TRADE and ENGAGE in <strong>DIRECT COMBAT</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy low, sell high, and invest in dividends to <strong>BUILD YOUR WEALTH</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INVEST</strong> as a day trader, long-term trader, or even become a high-risk crypto trader!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your action meter to launch an <strong>ATTACK</strong> or other special moves.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong> yourself by absorbing or reflecting enemy attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win your battle either by growing your net worth or driving your opponent into bankruptcy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:\u00a0</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stock market simulation <strong>built on fighting game fundamentals</strong>.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Arcade Action</strong> (Most fights take ~3 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 playable traders</strong> with unique stats and AI strategies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy-to-learn</strong> stock patterns so that you don't need to be a real trader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> for challenging your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of tutorials to teach you the ropes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full storyline, challenges, hidden secrets, multiple difficulties, and more to keep you engaged.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to trade!</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is Arcade Trading?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >$tock Fighter is designed to be approachable by anyone, despite the source material. It uses real trading concepts and abstracts them into easy-to-understand gameplay mechanics. <strong>You don't need to be a trader</strong> to follow along... take 10 minutes to learn the ropes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it like a sports anime where players pull out magical invisible &quot;Ghost Pass&quot; or unstoppable &quot;Dempsey Roll. They aren't really magic, but they allow a casual to follow the action.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For example:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stock data is abstracted into &quot;<strong>Stock Patterns</strong>&quot;. At a glance, you know that a GROW stock will rise slowly, and that a spiking PUMP AND DUMP is likely to crash at any moment.\u00a0</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your challenge isn't reading the data or even the trading itself, but developing your strategy for any market situation.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Corporate Nobility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/44e5d0a7c3395c24d3a9637289973c949e404521.jpg"},{"name":"A Star is Born","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/6324b1fed05364f81651f5ac32f661d9e624e2be.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Analyst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/d0cf3d4dff491000afdbd618fc8e27738cde8cb2.jpg"},{"name":"The Future of Trading","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/e3b2ae88b6f4e4189eabd547417c0f2fd5502f14.jpg"},{"name":"Phoenix Reborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/601ba6ac66a1049a887ff1463508c3a3df85a9f8.jpg"},{"name":"Heart of the Market","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/d4a19b91503d0488337c5d75c2b6f58658ee3ba2.jpg"},{"name":"Trade Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/392ffc2889cf4578ac5fe52d5625019b399deb3b.jpg"},{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/6dbf6a7f0949b193c36fe65de0256e211f11d9ab.jpg"},{"name":"Virtual Millionare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/fc21994614bfdfc9d844f2ebefce8aa6fd4187b3.jpg"},{"name":"And so it begins again...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3796760/f7ea2a295713352cc88eb49a94522b869d6dc510.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796760?t=1767977040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796760?t=1767977040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796760/9880ef916dacccb864c744a79084eb481c0528a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767977040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796760/9880ef916dacccb864c744a79084eb481c0528a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767977040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3977420,"de