o keep you engaged.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to trade!</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is Arcade Trading?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >$tock Fighter is designed to be approachable by anyone, despite the source material. It uses real trading concepts and abstracts them into easy-to-understand gameplay mechanics. <strong>You don't need to be a trader</strong> to follow along... take 10 minutes to learn the ropes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it like a sports anime where players pull out magical invisible &quot;Ghost Pass&quot; or unstoppable &quot;Dempsey Roll. They aren't really magic, but they allow a casual to follow the action.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For example:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stock data is abstracted into &quot;<strong>Stock Patterns</strong>&quot;. At a glance, you know that a GROW stock will rise slowly, and that a spiking PUMP AND DUMP is likely to crash at any moment.\u00a0</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your challenge isn't reading the data or even the trading itself, but developing your strategy for any market situation.</p>","developers":["McTeddy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796760/086fc726ef931441cd0fc35533ba5837c4fb0efc/header.jpg?t=1767977040","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Stock Fighter","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_d